Preface The International Conference «Innovations and Prospects of Development of Mining Machinery and Electrical Engineering» 2017 (IPDME2017) was held in Saint-Petersburg Mining University, Saint-Petersburg. Russia on March 23-25, 2017. The International Conference «Innovations and Prospects of Development of Mining Machinery and Electrical Engineering» 2017 (IPDME2017) was held in Saint-Petersburg Mining University, Saint-Petersburg. Russia on March 23-25, 2017. The Conference also provides an interdisciplinary forum for researchers, practitioners and scholars to present and discuss the most recent innovations and developments in the field of new recovery processes and transportation of mineral resources, industrial ecology, mining. List of Acknowledgment, Edited by, Program Committee, Organizing Committee are available in this PDF.

